<title>JAPAN: Reuters average October Tapis assessed at $25.70.</title>
<headline>Reuters average October Tapis assessed at $25.70.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuters price for Malaysian Tapis for October was $25.70.</p>
<p>Malaysia's Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its monthly term crude formula. Reuters prices:</p>
<p>     October  1  $24.65     2  $24.10     3  $24.50</p>
<p>		  4  $24.68     7  $25.13     8  $25.20</p>
<p>		  9  $25.55    10  $25.75    11  $25.65</p>
<p>		 14  $25.58    15  $25.45    16  $26.30</p>
<p>		 17  $26.35    18  $26.05    21  $26.38</p>
<p>		 22  $26.68    23  $26.50    24  $26.48</p>
<p>		 25  $25.93    28  $25.95    29  $26.28</p>
<p>		 30  $26.15    31  $25.83</p>
</text>
